  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  enabled: 1
  lines:
  - '*\tso how''s the traps\n\tbeen going?'
  - '* It''s been real\n  annoying.'
  - '* He''s just been making\n  Kris do all of them.'
  - '*\tsounds about right.'
  - '*\tbut what about all\n\tthe effort papyrus has\n\tbeen putting in?'
  - '* HE''S BEEN TRYING\n  TO KILL US.'
  - '*\tnah,^05 no way.'
  - '*\the''d never hurt a fly.'
  - '*\tor at least he\n\twouldn''t unprovoked.'
  - '* Then why does he\n  force us to do\n  dangerous puzzles?'
  - '*\tmethinks it''s not\n\tjust him.'
  - '*\tprolly would be a good idea\n\tto put into perspective\n\twhat''s going on.'
  - '* Hmm...'
  sounds:
  - snd_txtsans
  - snd_txtsus
  - snd_txtnoe
